flowchart TD
    REQ([HTTP request arrives]) --> AUTH[Auth middleware<br/>extract api_key]
    AUTH --> RULE[Lookup cached rule<br/>for api_key / endpoint]
    RULE --> RL[Rate limiter check]
    RL --> DEC{allowed?}
    DEC -->|Yes| ROUTE[Route to backend service]
    ROUTE --> RESP([200 + rate limit headers])
    DEC -->|No| BLOCK([429 Too Many Requests<br/>Retry-After header])
    DEC -->|Redis down + fail-open| ROUTE

    style RESP fill:#e0ffe0
    style BLOCK fill:#ffe0e0
